   "does": "Maps a score to a tier after clamping to 0…100 (NaN/Inf → 0) and rounding: ≥90 excellent, 75–<90 good, 60–<75 fair, 45–<60 payAttention, 30–<45 low, else veryLow.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
